{
  "ep": "EP07",
  "title": "动物园里的弹簧与叹气",
  "default_gap": 0.3,
  "gaps": {"B01": 0.6, "B04": 0.5, "B05en": 0.5, "B06en": 0.5, "B09": 1.0, "B10en": 0.5, "B14en": 0.5, "B15": 0.5, "B35": 0.5, "B36": 0.5, "B41": 0.5},
  "segments": [
    {"id": "B01", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "哒哒哒——！声音探险队，出发！"},
    {"id": "B02", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "小Q，天亮啦！今天我们出发去动物园，元音城堡第六站。上一站抓到的「唔」和「呜」，地图上那两格已经点亮。"},
    {"id": "X01", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "动物园！我要看熊猫！"},
    {"id": "B03", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "今天要抓的这两个，一个勤快得要命，一个懒得出奇。"},
    {"id": "X02", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "勤快的不太熟，懒的嘛，我们是老朋友。"},
    {"id": "B04", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "欢迎来到周末动物园！别急着往前冲——你先站住，听笼子里那只小鸟，它叫了一整个上午了。"},
    {"id": "X03", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "哇！有竹子！还有护士阿姨！它不累吗？"},
    {"id": "B05", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "它嘴里装了一根小弹簧，一直在干活。听——"},
    {"id": "B05en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "er"},
    {"id": "X04", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "呃——！好长！它舌头是不是打结了？"},
    {"id": "B06", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "没打结。它的舌头卷起来了，像一根小弹簧停在嘴巴正中间：舌尖轻轻往上抬，悬在半空，不许碰到上牙床；嘴唇一动不动，声音拖得长长的——"},
    {"id": "B06en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "er"},
    {"id": "X05", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "呃——我舌头僵住了！动不了啦！"},
    {"id": "B07", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "手贴上喉咙试试，是不是在嗡嗡地抖？对，声带在振动，所以它是个响亮的音。它叫卷舌弹簧精灵，就住在 bird 里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B07en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "bird."},
    {"id": "X06", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "bird！小鸟！"},
    {"id": "B08", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "记住口诀：舌头卷成小弹簧，呃——停在正中央。"},
    {"id": "B09", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "逛了一上午，走，回家。一到家，往沙发上一坐——"},
    {"id": "X07", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "呼——终于到家了。"},
    {"id": "B10", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "就是这一声！忙了一天，什么都不想干，嘴巴懒洋洋地叹一口气——"},
    {"id": "B10en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "uh"},
    {"id": "X08", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "呃……这也太短了吧？我还没听清就没了。"},
    {"id": "B11", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "短，就是它的本事。整个英语里最短、最省力、最放松的音，就是它。舌头平躺在嘴里，哪儿都不用力，嘴唇也懒得动一下，而且它从来不站重音，永远是队伍里最没存在感的那个。"},
    {"id": "X09", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "躺平！这个我在行！"},
    {"id": "B12", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "它叫偷懒叹气精灵，住在 banana 的第一个音节里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B12en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "banana."},
    {"id": "X10", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "banana！香蕉！"},
    {"id": "B13", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "记住口诀：嘴巴偷懒叹口气，呃，短得几乎听不见。"},
    {"id": "B14", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "两个精灵都念「呃」，怎么分？一个卷成弹簧，使劲，拖得老长；一个直接躺平，一闪就没。来，对比读三遍——"},
    {"id": "B14en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.75, "text": "bird. banana. bird. banana. bird. banana."},
    {"id": "X11", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.95, "text": "bird. banana. bird. banana. bird. banana."},
    {"id": "B15", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "漂亮！进入单词宝藏时间！每个单词两遍——先慢速，再常速。仔细听！"},
    {"id": "B16", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "bird."},
    {"id": "B17", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "小鸟。卷舌弹簧家的第一个小朋友，一上来就把舌头卷起来。"},
    {"id": "X12", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "bird！小鸟！"},
    {"id": "B18", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "bird."},
    {"id": "B19", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "girl."},
    {"id": "B20", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "女孩。还是那个弹簧，别松劲，拖住。"},
    {"id": "X13", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "girl！女孩！"},
    {"id": "B21", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "girl."},
    {"id": "B22", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "nurse."},
    {"id": "B23", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "护士。弹簧后面，还跟着一丝轻轻的气。"},
    {"id": "X14", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "nurse！护士阿姨！"},
    {"id": "B24", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "nurse."},
    {"id": "B25", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "banana."},
    {"id": "B26", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "香蕉。偷懒家的第一个小朋友——第一个音节，懒洋洋一叹。"},
    {"id": "X15", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "banana！香蕉！"},
    {"id": "B27", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "banana."},
    {"id": "B28", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "panda."},
    {"id": "B29", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "熊猫。最后一个音节，又是懒洋洋一叹。"},
    {"id": "X16", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "panda！熊猫！"},
    {"id": "B30", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "panda."},
    {"id": "B31", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "teacher."},
    {"id": "B32", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "老师。结尾那个音，叹一口气就收工。"},
    {"id": "X17", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "teacher！老师！"},
    {"id": "B33", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "teacher."},
    {"id": "B34", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "六个单词全部到手！进入口诀记忆屋，拍手跟我念——"},
    {"id": "B35", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.8, "text": "舌头卷成小弹簧，呃——停在正中央，小鸟 bird，女孩 girl，护士 nurse 忙又忙；嘴巴偷懒叹口气，呃，短得几乎听不见，香蕉 banana，熊猫 panda，老师 teacher 站一边。卷的是弹簧，懒的是叹气，一勤一懒要分清！"},
    {"id": "X18", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "舌头卷成小弹簧，呃——停在正中央，小鸟 bird，女孩 girl，护士 nurse 忙又忙；嘴巴偷懒叹口气，呃，短得几乎听不见，香蕉 banana，熊猫 panda，老师 teacher 站一边。卷的是弹簧，懒的是叹气，一勤一懒要分清！"},
    {"id": "B36", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "满血毕业！听辨大挑战来了！我念两个词，你竖起耳朵——哪个卷了舌头？第一题——"},
    {"id": "B37en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "bird. bed."},
    {"id": "X19", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "第一个 bird，舌头卷起来了！第二个 bed 是床，没卷！"},
    {"id": "B37", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "全对！第二个 bed 用的就是我们在早餐桌上抓到的小口精灵。奖励一颗星！第二题——"},
    {"id": "B38en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "work. walk."},
    {"id": "X20", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "嗯……两个都是 walk！都是走路！我在走路！"},
    {"id": "B38", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "揭晓——第一个是 work，工作！卷舌弹簧在里面使劲呢。第二个才是 walk，走路。"},
    {"id": "X21", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊？工作不是走路吗？我每天都走路上学……"},
    {"id": "B39", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "那叫上学，不叫上班，以后你就懂了。第三题，最后一题——"},
    {"id": "B39en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "her. hat."},
    {"id": "X22", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "her 是她的，卷舌！hat 是帽子，下巴掉下去！"},
    {"id": "B40", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "完全正确！今天两颗半星，收好。"},
    {"id": "B41", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "今天的探险就到这里。下一站，我们去参加一场生日派对。"},
    {"id": "X23", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "生日派对！有蛋糕吗？"},
    {"id": "B42", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "有蛋糕，还有两个特别爱滑滑梯的精灵——一个从「诶」滑到「衣」，一个从「啊」滑到「衣」。声音探险队，下一站见！"},
    {"id": "X24", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "下一站见！我要吃蛋糕！"}
  ]
}
